</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S4.SS14" title="In 4 Experiments ‣ Encoder Winners Do Not Reliably Transfer Across VLA Backbone Scale:A Frozen-Backbone Grafting Diagnostic" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">4.14 </span>Training-loss plateau evidence for the <math class="ltx_Math" alttext="2{,}000" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>2,000</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">2{,}000</annotation></semantics></math>-step budget</span></a></li>
