<ol class="ltx_toclist ltx_toclist_subsection">
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S5.SS5.SSS0.Px1" title="In 5.5 Limitations ‣ 5 Discussion ‣ Encoder Winners Do Not Reliably Transfer Across VLA Backbone Scale:A Frozen-Backbone Grafting Diagnostic" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Preprocessing-protocol confound.</span></a></li>
