<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S5.SS5.SSS0.Px3" title="In 5.5 Limitations ‣ 5 Discussion ‣ Encoder Winners Do Not Reliably Transfer Across VLA Backbone Scale:A Frozen-Backbone Grafting Diagnostic" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Shuffle-tolerance of the <math class="ltx_Math" alttext="\pi_{0.5}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>π</mi><mn>0.5</mn></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\pi_{0.5}</annotation></semantics></math>-<span class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">spatial</span> ranking.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S5.SS5.SSS0.Px4" title="In 5.5 Limitations ‣ 5 Discussion ‣ Encoder Winners Do Not Reliably Transfer Across VLA Backbone Scale:A Frozen-Backbone Grafting Diagnostic" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Two-to-three seeds per cell.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S5.SS5.SSS0.Px5" title="In 5.5 Limitations ‣ 5 Discussion ‣ Encoder Winners Do Not Reliably Transfer Across VLA Backbone Scale:A Frozen-Backbone Grafting Diagnostic" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Offline action MSE rather than closed-loop success.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S5.SS5.SSS0.Px6" title="In 5.5 Limitations ‣ 5 Discussion ‣ Encoder Winners Do Not Reliably Transfer Across VLA Backbone Scale:A Frozen-Backbone Grafting Diagnostic" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Two released backbones at different scales, not isolated scale.</span></a></li>
